  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Love the new UI so far but thought it seems kinda silly that the menu wings in the main, larger, menu mirror what you have set in the quick menu. I feel like the kind of information you would want to have at a quick glance would be very different depending on which of these two menus you are in.\nLike a quick glance in the quick menu might be great for my online friends and avatars. Alternatively, if I went through the effort of opening the larger menu, I might want my own and favorited worlds pinned.\nI love the implementation but think they could be so much more useful if they were two separate sets of wings! Or course, you could just manually set them to be the same in both if you wanted to keep it the same.",
